# by itself.
#
# Mirrors are distribution channels, not trust anchors. Package trust must come
# from schweisos-keyring, package signatures, and repository signature policy.

## Official SchweisOS repository endpoint
##
## Bootstrap status:
## This is the canonical official endpoint reserved for the first SchweisOS
## package repository. Public repository infrastructure is not implemented yet.
##
## Future official mirrors should be added below this section after the
## canonical endpoint is operational and mirror policy is documented.

Server = https://repo.schweisos.org/$repo/os/$arch

## Future community mirrors
##
## Community mirrors must not be added to this package until SchweisOS has a
## documented mirror policy, health-check process, and publication workflow.
## Mirror operators do not become trust anchors.
